sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as Profile UI
    participant NM as NetworkManager
    participant A as Profile A session
    participant B as Profile B session
    participant Adapter as ChromiumNetworkAdapter

    User->>UI: Switch from A to B
    UI->>NM: switchProfileNetwork(profileB)
    NM->>A: Stop or transition session
    NM->>Adapter: clearNetworkConfiguration()
    NM->>Adapter: applyNetworkConfiguration(configB)
    Adapter-->>NM: Route B applied
    NM->>B: Start or resume session
    B-->>NM: Restore profile B state
    NM-->>UI: Report profile B status
    UI-->>User: Show B as active
